[node name="text" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Control"]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 240.0
offset_top = 186.0
offset_right = 533.0
offset_bottom = 481.0
theme = ExtResource("5_01hes")
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("6_dm1x1")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 8
text = "BULLET:

Can move slow to fast, randomized..... does 1 damage, normal parry. +1 PARRY


Speeder:

fast moving bullet, the slowest speeder is still faster than the fastest bullet. 0.5 dmg, normal parry. +1 parry.


Upgrader:

Instantly upgrades, doesn't change the next milestone for the next upgrade. SPECIAL PARRY: when parried, doubles the milestone without recieving an upgrade.


helper:

Helper heals you on contact, +1 hp. If you are fully healed, 1 gets added to your max health. When parried, you lose 1 max health.


LOOKER:

The looker is a slow-moving bullet where your shield points to until the looker gets destroyed, there can only be 1 looker at a times.s"

[node name="types2" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Control"]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 562.0
offset_top = 161.0
offset_right = 754.0
offset_bottom = 194.0
