text = "UPGRADES:"

[node name="text2" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Control"]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 558.0
offset_top = 191.0
offset_right = 851.0
offset_bottom = 486.0
theme = ExtResource("5_01hes")
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("6_dm1x1")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 8
text = "TWICE THE GAMBLE:

Two times more bullets spawns, but that also means more frequent upgrades, and bigger chance for healing. (stackable)


DASH:

ABILITY: CLick right mouse button to teleport to your cursor, cooldown: 30s. After first upgrade, decreases cooldown by 1 second. (max. 10 seconds)


TWICE THE POWER:

GAIN A WHOLE EXTRA SHIELD TO PARRY WITH.


PRAYED UPON:

Gain parries when you take damage


HEAL FOR LIFE:

Spawn more healing bullets (+2%). Maxes at 20% heal.s


Healer:

Heals .5 hp every 15 seconds.


DEATH TO SPEED:

Every time this upgrade is chosen, -1 chance that the speeder bullets are chosen. base is 1/5 (so after this it's 1/6, then 1/7, 1/8, etc.....)


PRAYED FAST:

Become faster (stackable)."

